      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Each rarity has a dedicated Ranking Pool consisting of Token like BCOIN,
    SEN.


    Only heroes with the equivalent rarity can mine the reward in its
    rarity pool.

    Only Hero S with staking is eligible for rewards. The type
    of token rewarded depends on the staked tokens.


    The better your heroes
    better chance they able to mine the reward

    Every 60s, the system will determine
    which heroes get the rewards base on the <color=green>Staked amount of your SHeroes</color>.


    Every
    pool amount will be renewed after 24h no matter how much are left.

'
